      "full_text": "He was a proud member of the Delaware Tribe. Nick is also survived by his loving \n  wife, Nancy; children, Michael James, Scott Douglas Young, Angela Michelle Young \n  and Stephen Ryan (Charlotte); grandchildren, Kimberly, Gish, Seth, Morgan, Corbin, \n  brothers; Benjamin Jr. (Lena) and Stephen (Cynthia) Nolan; uncles, David Saunders \n  and Herbie Pierce; aunt, Lorraine Saunders, and many nieces, nephews and cousins. \n  He was a member of the US Air Force for 32 years, the American Legion, Pataskala \n  Lions Club, The Republican Party Campaign and served his community with his \n  whole heart.",
